    tippecc_data:rsds.comment "mo: For instantaneous outputs, this diagnostic represents an average over the radiation time step using the state of the atmosphere (T,q,clouds) from the first dynamics step within that interval. The time coordinate is the start of the radiation time step interval, so the value for t(N) is the average from t(N) to t(N+1)., CMIP_table_comment: Surface solar irradiance for UV calculations."^^xsd:string ;
